Data licence — data-combined releases
=====================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository. It does not
cover the data published in this repository's releases, and no licence is
granted over that data.

combined-data.json, and the departed-movies.json bundle beside it, are internal
build artifacts. They exist to feed clusterflick.com and the rest of the
Clusterflick pipeline. They are published here because the pipeline runs in the
open, not as a dataset offered for reuse.

They are the merge of every upstream stage — the transformed venue data, the
cached film metadata and the seen registry — so they carry whatever those
stages carry, including film metadata from The Movie Database used under the
TMDB API terms of use (https://www.themoviedb.org/api-terms-of-use).

Concretely:

